# Standard cargo-fuzz ignores (this dir is its own root; the repo .gitignore's
# /target is root-anchored and does NOT cover fuzz/target).
/target
/corpus
/artifacts
/coverage
# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED on purpose: it is the input to the fuzz supply-chain
# gate (cargo deny / cargo audit on the detached fuzz workspace — see
# fuzz/deny.toml + the CLW_FUZZ_GATE lane in scripts/gates.sh). Do NOT re-ignore.
